From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:22:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Trabis: MwSt payments to the Finanzamt + government
 payments without invoice
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- MwSt-Zahlung: separate state.vatPayments (date, period, amount); lowers only the
  MwSt of the month it pays for, never Netto; kept out of UVA/profit; each year
  stands on its own. "Bezahlen" on the month card, prefilled with the month's open
  VAT; settled month shows "bezahlt". Own group in the month's expenses.
- Behörde bezahlen: pick an entity (incl. fixed list, created on first use), amount,
  date -> expense with 0 % VAT, category Government, govId. Also from each entity
  card. "Finanzamt — MwSt-Zahlung" opens the VAT payment instead.
- CHANGES_FOR_BACKEND.md: steps 2 and 3 for the server build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WrSmbPeJ9qpSAgv9M15c7v
